# AhmiPrint: a typewriter and newspaper slab serif, drawn as strokes on a 24-unit grid
# (baseline 0, x-height 14, cap height 20, ascender 21, descender -6).
# glyph <char-code> adv=<units>
#   L x0,y0 x1,y1            line
#   A cx,cy rx,ry a0 a1      elliptical arc, degrees counter-clockwise from +x
#   Q x0,y0 cx,cy x1,y1      quadratic curve
#   D x,y                    dot (a round terminal)
# Stroke weight comes from the renderer (regular 2.6, bold 3.8). Every terminal is round,
# like typewriter ink. Slab serifs are strokes of the same weight as the stems.

